618	    /**
619	     * Counts the members of the owner-to-be's household after this create, i.e. one more than the
620	     * number of existing owners already carrying the same {@code householdId}. The household
621	     * identifier is a deterministic function of last name and postcode, so a solo owner (the only one
622	     * with that identifier) is a household of one. The count includes the owner being created (hence
